kdeglance (2.0.4-1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian/Ubuntu packaging.
  * Built from the 2.0.4 source tree with Dolphin integration, libraw and
    KWindowSystem support enabled.
  * The Dolphin plugins install into the multiarch Qt plugin directory
    (/usr/lib/<triplet>/qt6/plugins) so they are found without QT_PLUGIN_PATH.
  * The viewer service is installed as a D-Bus activated systemd user unit.

 -- KDEGlance contributors <noreply@github.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 17:06:45 +1100
